# Static Routing Lab - 3 Router Topology

## Objective
Configure static routing between three routers and verify end-to-end connectivity.

## Technologies Used
- Cisco Packet Tracer
- Static Routing
- ICMP
- ARP
- IPv4 Addressing

## Issue Encountered
Initial pings failed despite correct routing configuration.

## Root Cause
Routers required ARP resolution before forwarding traffic successfully.

## Outcome
Successfully achieved full connectivity and reinforced understanding of ARP behaviour in routed networks.
